<title>JAPAN: General Motors' unit launches 2.1% samurai - Merrill.</title>
<headline>General Motors' unit launches 2.1% samurai - Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai bonds issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch on Monday:</p>
<p>BORROWER General Motors Acceptance Corp (GMAC)</p>
<p>    AMT	20 bln yen</p>
<p>    COUPON   2.1 pct</p>
<p>    MATURITY 25 March 2002</p>
<p> TYPE		Samurai</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 99.95 yen</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  24 Dec 1996</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	Dec 2 to Dec 20</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     S&amp;P A-, Moody's A3</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGERS   Merrill Lynch</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    Sanwa Bank</p>
</text>
